OL,3,GNEWSAGold Elizabethan posy ring found
OL,4,Ain field
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was just 15 minutes into a normal
OL,7,Fevening of metal detecting that Kevin
OL,8,FShort found something extraordinary in
OL,9,Fa Warwickshire field.
OL,11,FSpotting something gold buried a
OL,12,Fcoupled of inches beneath the soil, he
OL,13,Fpulled it out, revealing a gold posy
OL,14,Fring with the inscription "I live in
OL,15,Fhope" on the inside.
OL,17,F"I was genuinely surprised to find
OL,18,Fsomething like this so quickly... I
OL,19,Fknew straight away it was gold,
OL,20,Falthough I had no idea of its quality
OL,21,For how significant it might be," he
OL,22,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
