OL,3,GNEWSAGold Elizabethan posy ring found
OL,4,Ain field
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Elizabethan ring was dated as being
OL,7,Ffrom the 16th to 18th century by the
OL,8,FBritish Museum. It will go up for
OL,9,Fauction at Oxfordshire-based Holloways
OL,10,FAuctioneers on 2 December with a sale
OL,11,Fprice of between #2,000 - #3,000.
